      "customfield_10050": "TC-PAY-011",
      "description": "Implement exponential backoff retry logic for failed webhook deliveries. After max retries (configurable, default 5), failed events are moved to a dead letter queue for manual investigation. DLQ stored in mfs_payments_db.webhook_dlq table on pghost-prod-01.mfs.internal. Admin UI shows DLQ entries with retry/discard actions.\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- Exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, 16s\n- DLQ entries include original payload, error, attempt count\n- Admin API for DLQ management\n- Deploy to mfs-pay-pod-01, mfs-pay-pod-02\n\nGitLab MR: !602\nChange Request: CHG0090501\nTest Cases: TC-PAY-011",
